# AI & GPU Algorithms

A personal workspace for AI algorithm implementations and GPU/CUDA programming projects.

## Structure

- `AI algorithms implementations/` — existing AI algorithm work and HackerRank AI problems.
- `cuda-hpc/` — CUDA / GPU high-performance computing projects (new).
  - `01_parallel_ode_integrator/` — CPU vs. GPU ODE solver benchmark (in progress).

## Working with Claude on this repo

This repo is connected to a Claude Code session on branch `claude/repo-access-editing-vupm3c`.

- Ask for changes in plain language ("add a RK4 CUDA kernel to the ODE integrator", "benchmark this against the CPU version").
- Claude edits files, runs builds/tests locally, and commits + pushes to the branch above — it will tell you before pushing.
- To review changes: open a PR from `claude/repo-access-editing-vupm3c` into `main` on GitHub, or ask Claude to open one.
- Claude won't touch files outside what you ask it to change — existing folders (like `AI algorithms implementations/`) are left alone unless you request edits there.
